Recommends: gnome-shell-extension-blur-my-shell, aphelion, wine, wine64, fonts-wine, wsdd, @RECOMMENDS@
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Description: Orbit OS desktop
 Installs and configures the Orbit OS desktop (GNOME 48 on Debian 13): theme and
 dconf defaults, Orbit Launcher, Orbit Settings, first-run welcome, the
 ~/Home folder layout for new users, firewall on, fingerprint PAM,
 automatic security updates.
